    {
      "id": "Fire",
      "title_zh": "火焰",
      "fully_translated": true,
      "figures_zh": [],
      "content_zh": "<ul><li>火焰可由绝大多数火焰类武器与战略配备施加。</li></ul><p><strong>值得注意的火焰威胁</strong></p><p><strong>环境危险</strong></p><ul><li>爆炸桶</li><li>火焰龙卷</li><li>火山植物</li></ul><p><strong>敌人</strong></p><ul><li>部分机器人单位：炽灼巨型者、炽灼部队、炽灼劫掠者、燃烧机枪蹂躏者、炽灼蹂躏者、炽灼火箭蹂躏者、巨型炙炎者</li><li>终结族：蟑龙</li><li>光能族：激光武器、猎杀器、凝视者</li></ul><p><strong>绝地潜兵一侧</strong></p><ul><li>主武器：AR-2 野狼、SMG/FLAM-34 司炉者（Stoker）、FLAM-66 火炬手、LAS-5 长柄镰、LAS-17 双刃镰刀（过热时）、SG-225IE 高燃破裂者、SG-451 野炊</li><li>副武器：LAS-7 匕首、P-72 迅击</li><li>投掷物：G-10 燃烧弹、G-13 燃烧冲击弹、G-142 烟花术</li><li>支援武器：FLAM-40 火焰喷射器、B/FLAM-80 焚燃者、LAS-98 激光大炮、EAT-700 一次性凝固汽油弹</li><li>战略配备：火焰喷射哨戒炮、激光哨戒炮、飞鹰凝固汽油弹空袭、轨道凝固汽油弹火力网、AX-FLAM75 热狗、AX-LAS5 漫游车、MD-14 燃烧地雷</li></ul><p>火焰伤害为 <strong>AP4 重甲穿透</strong>，未修正的持续时间为 <strong>3 秒</strong>（数值见下表）。</p><p>许多单位对元素伤害有单独的倍率，火焰也不例外。例如胆汁喷涌虫承受标准火焰伤害，而穿刺虫承受 <strong>1.7 倍</strong>火焰伤害。</p>",
      "tables_zh": [
        {
          "html": "<table class=\"wikitable tableleftjustified Secondcolumnright table-weapon-stats attack-data-table-status\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">火焰</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">状态</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态持续时间</td>\n<td>3 秒</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">伤害</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元素</td>\n<td>火焰</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准伤害</td>\n<td><span class=\"DamageIcons icon-outline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage\" title=\"Damage\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"./assets/mechanics/status_effects/Damage_Fire_Icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"DamageIcons\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Damage_Types\" title=\"Damage\"><span style=\"color: orangered;\">100 火焰</span></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耐久伤害</td>\n<td><span class=\"DamageIcons icon-outline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage\" title=\"Damage\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"./assets/mechanics/status_effects/Damage_Fire_Icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"DamageIcons\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Damage_Types\" title=\"Damage\"><span style=\"color: orangered;\">100 火焰</span></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">穿透</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直射穿透</td>\n<td><span class=\"Templateicons icon-outline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Armor_Penetration_&amp;_Armor_Values\" title=\"Damage\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"./assets/mechanics/status_effects/Armor_AP4_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"188\" height=\"221\" data-file-width=\"188\" data-file-height=\"221\" /></a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Armor_Penetration_&amp;_Armor_Values\" title=\"Damage\">重甲</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小角度穿透</td>\n<td><span class=\"Templateicons icon-outline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Armor_Penetration_&amp;_Armor_Values\" title=\"Damage\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"./assets/mechanics/status_effects/Armor_AP4_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"188\" height=\"221\" data-file-width=\"188\" data-file-height=\"221\" /></a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Armor_Penetration_&amp;_Armor_Values\" title=\"Damage\">重甲</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大角度穿透</td>\n<td><span class=\"Templateicons icon-outline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Armor_Penetration_&amp;_Armor_Values\" title=\"Damage\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"./assets/mechanics/status_effects/Armor_AP4_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"188\" height=\"221\" data-file-width=\"188\" data-file-height=\"221\" /></a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Armor_Penetration_&amp;_Armor_Values\" title=\"Damage\">重甲</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极端角度穿透</td>\n<td><span class=\"Templateicons icon-outline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Armor_Penetration_&amp;_Armor_Values\" title=\"Damage\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"./assets/mechanics/status_effects/Armor_AP0_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"188\" height=\"221\" data-file-width=\"188\" data-file-height=\"221\" /></a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Damage#Armor_Penetration_&amp;_Armor_Values\" title=\"Damage\">无护甲</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">特殊效果</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆毁值</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>踉跄力</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推力</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Fire_Panic",
      "title_zh": "火焰恐慌",
      "fully_translated": true,
      "content_zh": "<p>火焰恐慌（Fire Panic）是与毒气混乱类似的症状：被火焰<strong>直接命中</strong>的敌人会随机移动、随机攻击。只有直接喷射火焰的武器才能施加此效果，例如 FLAM-40 火焰喷射器、B/FLAM-80 焚燃者、火焰喷射哨戒炮、FLAM-66 火炬手，以及唯一的 40-K 热熔枪。<strong>重型／巨型敌人免疫此效果。</strong></p>",
